              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadinezari aravuga ati “Imana ya Saduraka na Meshaki na Abedenego ishimwe, ni yo yohereje marayika wayo ikiza abagaragu bayo bayiringiye, kuko bigurukije ijambo ry'umwami bagahara amagara yabo, kugira ngo batagira indi mana yose bakorera cyangwa basenga itari Imana yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.28"
            ]
          }
        }
