              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jyewe Umwami Nebukadinezari ndabandikiye, bantu mwese bo mu moko yose y'indimi zitari zimwe bari mu isi yose. Amahoro agwire muri mwe!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3.31-33:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "muri Bibliya Yera ya mbere, iyi mirongo ni 4.1-3; bityo, 4.4-37 ihwanye na 4.1-34 muri iyi Bibliya, nk'uko biri mu Ruheburayo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nishimiye kwerura ibimenyetso n'ibitangaza Imana Isumbabyose yankoreye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erega ibimenyetso byayo ni byinshi, ibitangaza byayo birakomeye! Ubwami bwayo ni bwo bwami butazashira, kandi ingoma yayo ihoraho uko ibihe bihaye ibindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.33"
            ]
